      "spam": false,
      "value": "I would love to have a nice big open world too, but I foresee it not working as well.  SLK was built from the ground up with a Grid.  We have already seen how in VRchat, when we have alot of things, even in the background, alot of players can cause some video lag.  VRchat would have to be rebuilt to handle those kinds of things.  VRchat is not an MMO with persistant world, it's instance based, that is the design, more compact.  It works for what it is, but yes, it would be nice to have more world to explore.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
